  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Project is to strengthen the competitiveness of smallholder farmers in the Project Provinces, through enhancement of agricultural technology, fostering of farmers&#x2019; organizations and their linkages to agri-businesses, and provision of critical public infrastructure.</narrative>
